cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Delirium Prediction Pipeline (Leakage-Free Dynamic Model)"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Jungmin"
    family-names: "You"
    email: "jmyou@yuhs.ac"
license: "MIT"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-03-14"
abstract: >-
  Modular codebase for leakage-free delirium prediction with TimeGAN and
  DTW-SMOTE augmentation, multi-task soft-gated LSTM modeling, and fidelity
  analyses. Includes a synthetic-data generator that mirrors the manuscript
  variable schema so the full workflow is reproducible without access to the
  IRB-restricted source data.
keywords:
  - delirium
  - time-series
  - data-augmentation
  - timegan
  - dtw-smote
  - lstm
